<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said on Thursday that it qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Corinth CSD, N.Y., $3.935 million school district general obligations.</p>
<p>--Glen Falls CSD, N.Y., $1.09 million school district GOs.</p>
<p>--University of South Carolina, S.C., $4.5 million revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
